 ◆ Feature exerciser — code                                                     
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
                                                                                
 Fences, indented code, the line-number gutter and the horizontal-scroll path.  
 This fixture is also rendered once with line_numbers on, so the gutter has a   
 golden of its own.                                                             
                                                                                
